      <DisplayName>Arcane Capacity Module (legacy compact)</DisplayName>
      <Description>Preserved compact block for existing saves.
New construction uses the three-cell pillar installation.

Attach to a side-center Energy Core socket, with the connector/forward face toward the core.
Requires a matching or stronger top stabilizer.
Stores 10000 MWh in this block; removal retains its charge, destruction loses it, new/projected/copied blocks start empty.
The core sets bank transfer limits and charge mode.</Description>
